    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Riociguat: soluble guanylate cyclase stimulator (nitric oxide pathway); ↑6-min walk distance, ↓PVR and improved functional class, alone or added to an ERA or prostacyclin analog; CTEPH not a surgical candidate: ↑exercise capacity and ↓PVR."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Never combine riociguat w a PDE-5 inhibitor: both ↑cGMP, risk of dangerous hypotension."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Sotatercept: activin signaling inhibitor; added to standard background tx it improved the 6-min walk test at 24 wk (phase 3)."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Lung disease w hypoxia: supplemental O2 plus tx of the primary disorder."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
